  <div style="background:#f8f8f8; border-left:3px solid var(--color-accent); padding:0.75rem 1.25rem; border-radius:0 4px 4px 0; margin-bottom:2rem; font-size:0.95rem;">
    Part of our offer ladder, level 4: Executive Revenue Advisory. <a href="/en/sales-transformation/">See the full offer &rarr;</a>
  </div>

  <h1>Strategic Advisory</h1>
  <p class="lead">For CEOs, sales managers and commercial leaders who want to improve their organisation's ability to win deals.</p>
  <div class="section">
    <p>The advisory isn't about delivering a report with 47 slides and a generic action plan. It's about solving the commercial problem you actually have, and building the capability to handle the next one.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="section">
    <h2>What we work on</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Commercial diagnosis</strong>, where are you today, where is it leaking, and why?</li>
